    "trigger": "talk/spec001:HOTSPOT-titan",
    "captionId": "spec001:DIALOGUE-VOICE-019"
  },
  {
    "assetId": "spec001:ASSET-VOICE-020",
    "roomId": "spec001:R02",
    "exportPath": "public/assets/audio/voices/voice-020.mp3",
    "channel": "voice",
    "label": "Titan — key-clue 020",
    "text": "For this investigation, these endpoints are known good. We are testing the physical path between them.",
    "loop": false,
    "trigger": "fact/spec001:FACT-endpoints",
    "captionId": "spec001:DIALOGUE-VOICE-020"
  },
  {
    "assetId": "spec001:ASSET-VOICE-021",
    "roomId": "spec001:R02",
    "exportPath": "public/assets/audio/voices/voice-021.mp3",
    "channel": "voice",
    "label": "Titan — tutorial 021",
    "text": "Write what you saw under Evidence. Put what you think it means under Hypotheses.",
    "loop": false,
    "trigger": "look/spec001:HOTSPOT-hypothesis",
    "captionId": "spec001:DIALOGUE-VOICE-021"
  },
  {
    "assetId": "spec001:ASSET-VOICE-022",
    "roomId": "spec001:R02",
    "exportPath": "public/assets/audio/voices/voice-022.mp3",
    "channel": "voice",
    "label": "Titan — tutorial 022",
    "text": "Copper, fiber and radio can each offer a valid route here. Choose one, then prove that your choice meets its stated conditions.",
    "loop": false,
    "trigger": "look/spec001:HOTSPOT-routes",
    "captionId": "spec001:DIALOGUE-VOICE-022"
  },
  {
    "assetId": "spec001:ASSET-VOICE-023",
    "roomId": "spec001:R02",
    "exportPath": "public/assets/audio/voices/voice-023.mp3",
    "channel": "voice",
    "label": "Titan — key-clue 023",
    "text": "An ally can help you inspect or change the declared system. A conventional tool can still solve a required repair.",
    "loop": false,
    "trigger": "look/spec001:HOTSPOT-golem",
    "captionId": "spec001:DIALOGUE-VOICE-023"
  },
  {
    "assetId": "spec001:ASSET-VOICE-024",
    "roomId": "spec001:R02",
    "exportPath": "public/assets/audio/voices/voice-024.mp3",
    "channel": "voice",
    "label": "Titan — tutorial 024",
    "text": "You may bring two active allies. Change your team at a safe place; preparation is part of engineering.",
    "loop": false,
    "trigger": "panel/party",
    "captionId": "spec001:DIALOGUE-VOICE-024"
  },
  {
    "assetId": "spec001:ASSET-VOICE-025",
    "roomId": "spec001:R02",
    "exportPath": "public/assets/audio/auditions/titan-025.mp3",
    "channel": "voice",
    "label": "Titan — key-clue 025",
    "text": "A physical link can work while an application fails. Name exactly what your test establishes.",
    "loop": false,
    "trigger": "look/spec001:HOTSPOT-declared-path",
    "captionId": "spec001:DIALOGUE-VOICE-025"
  },
  {
    "assetId": "spec001:ASSET-VOICE-026",
    "roomId": "spec001:R02",
    "exportPath": "public/assets/audio/voices/voice-026.mp3",
    "channel": "voice",
    "label": "Titan — tutorial 026",
    "text": "A hint is another tool. We record its use so the story is honest, not so the ending can scold you.",
    "loop": false,
    "trigger": "discuss-recorded-hint",
    "captionId": "spec001:DIALOGUE-VOICE-026"
  },
  {
    "assetId": "spec001:ASSET-VOICE-027",
    "roomId": "spec001:R02",
    "exportPath": "public/assets/audio/voices/voice-027.mp3",
    "channel": "voice",
    "label": "Titan — key-clue 027",
    "text": "Changing the path changes the question. An earlier passing measurement cannot validate the new configuration.",
